"""
Lustre Storage Performance Monitor
==================================

Python 2.7 compatible.

The collection and rate-calculation algorithm is intentionally based on
Lustre cumulative counters and snapshot_time.

Keys:

    q       Quit
    r       Refresh immediately

Examples:

    python2.7 lustre_monitor.py

    python2.7 lustre_monitor.py \
        --oss ookami04 \
        --oss ookami05 \
        --mds ookami02

    python2.7 lustre_monitor.py --once

    python2.7 lustre_monitor.py \
        --oss ookami04 \
        --mds ookami02 \
        --once


This program collects Lustre performance information using:

    ssh
    /usr/sbin/lctl get_param

